      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "",
      "text": "One of Yuma's classmates, Cathy Katherine, grew jealous of the special relationship that Tori and Yuma seemed to possess."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": "It was this jealousy that drove her to command her army of cats to remove Tori from the picture..."
